WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.430
Chapter 2.

2
00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:06.590
Seven rules are painted on a barn
wall, for every animal to see.

3
00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.280
Seasons pass.

4
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:10.520
One rule grows a little longer.

5
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.640
Then another.

6
00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.140
Then a third.

7
00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:14.540
Chapter 8.

8
00:00:14.590 --> 00:00:17.870
A ladder in the night,
and a pot of white paint.

9
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:20.650
The animals stare at the wall, puzzled.

10
00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.840
Seven rules on a barn wall.

11
00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.660
Who keeps changing them?

12
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:29.890
In this mission, you'll meet satire, and
the different kinds of irony Orwell uses.

13
00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:33.830
You'll track the rules one by
one, and how each one shifts.

14
00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:37.520
And you'll learn to spot more
than the animals ever do.

15
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:41.080
Your mission: find out who
keeps changing the rules.
